[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2460.39, "timestamp": "00:41:00", "text": "數學。它是 515 20%。哦，已經過去一段時間了。假期過得怎麼樣？假期很愉快。  我花時間陪伴家人。  我需要一些和家人在一起的時光。挺好的。很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2466.63, "timestamp": "00:41:06", "text": "喜歡。  是的。我覺得我需要把那些照片和其他東西都保存下來。  我的手機儲存空間已滿。滿的。  我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2472.71, "timestamp": "00:41:12", "text": "手機儲存空間已滿。兄弟，我需要一張"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2476.39, "timestamp": "00:41:16", "text": "記憶卡，我今天買了一張。我是在回家的路上訂購的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2478.764, "timestamp": "00:41:18", "author": "@nathan_sketches6999", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/KmqDcUvqYZWpnpDRlwZ07HrTcx9HBtPNTGmavJGGwZD7_DJfftu7TwZhPlwhdtlwvfNfNf63tw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "AYE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2486.47, "timestamp": "00:41:26", "text": "嗯……那是一張 SanDisk 的 256 GB 記憶卡。我的手機內部儲存空間現在是128。我當時想："}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2493.608, "timestamp": "00:41:33", "author": "@nathan_sketches6999", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/KmqDcUvqYZWpnpDRlwZ07HrTcx9HBtPNTGmavJGGwZD7_DJfftu7TwZhPlwhdtlwvfNfNf63tw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "just so you know, I might be one of the OLD GUARD!!!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2496.069, "timestamp": "00:41:36", "text": "「好吧，只要我插入新的記憶卡，就不會再出現『沒有裝置"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2504.945, "timestamp": "00:41:44", "author": "@nathan_sketches6999", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/KmqDcUvqYZWpnpDRlwZ07HrTcx9HBtPNTGmavJGGwZD7_DJfftu7TwZhPlwhdtlwvfNfNf63tw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "but yes I am very foriegn XDD"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2507.829, "timestamp": "00:41:47", "text": "儲存空間』之類的錯誤訊息了。」 我當時就想，「是啊，這事兒到此為止了。」但我大錯特錯了。所有這些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2509.67, "timestamp": "00:41:49", "text": "應用。不，就像我每次在應用程式商店看到一些"}]